|{{center|this text<br/>is center justified}}
|-
|{{tl|right}}
|<code><nowiki>{{right|this text<br/>is right justified}}</nowiki></code>
|{{right|this text<br/>is right justified}}
|-
|{{tl|block left}}, {{tl|float left}}
|<code><nowiki>{{block left|this block of text<br/>is left justified}}</nowiki></code>
|{{block  left|this block of text<br/>is left justified}}
