{{template shortcut|a+}}
{{span-based-template}}
{{Uses TemplateStyles|Template:Anchor/styles.css}}

==Usage==
This template provides an anchor on the page, along with visible text, which will be highlighted when a link to the anchor is followed. The visible text is not necessarily the same as the anchor name.

===Examples===

====Anchor with name and text identical====

<pre>
{{anchor+|Anchor}}
</pre>

{{anchor+|Anchor}}

:Creates the anchor named "Anchor", with the visible text "Anchor". The anchor is reachable by the link [[{{FULLPAGENAME}}#Anchor]].

====Anchor with name and text different====

<pre>
{{anchor+|Anchor1|Visible anchor text}}
</pre>

{{anchor+|Anchor1|Visible anchor text}}

==See also==
* {{tl|anchor}} - can carry multiple variables, though no visible text

